standardization oftentimes in continuing education or professional development sessions in general. And I think diversity education is just one more place where this is a problem. My hope, though, is that at least that we can establish some standard vocabulary in terms of what are the key educational metrics that we want folks to get out of diversity education. How can we measure them? and what are the best practices that are best aligned for those metrics, right? So you kind of create this level of professionalization that we see in other educational domains, but it just hasn't happened yet, I think, due to the, in some ways, the kind of history and origins of where diversity education came from.
标准化。我认为多样性教育只是又一个存在这个问题的领域。不过，我的希望是，至少我们可以建立一些标准的词汇，来定义我们希望人们从多样性教育中获得的关键教育指标是什么。我们如何衡量它们？哪些是与这些指标最相符的最佳实践，对吧？因此，你创造了我们在其他教育领域看到的这种专业化水平，但它还没有发生，我认为，这在某些方面归因于多样性教育的历史和起源。

